  "name": "Question 9",
  "problem": "Write the equation of the hyperbola $9{y}^{2}-3{x}^{2}=54$ in standard form.",
  "worked_solution": "The Cartesian equation of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, to write the equation of the hyperbola in standard form, we need to divide both sides of the equation by $54$ and then simplify, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{y}^{2}-3{x}^{2} & =54 \\\\ \\frac{9{y}^{2}}{54}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{54} & =\\frac{54}{54} \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{6}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{18} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
